    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35651" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-trītus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>quite worn out</i>, <i>very
			hackneyed</i> or <i>common</i>, <i>very
				trite</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaestio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 7, 18, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scio pertritum jam hoc esse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 63, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
